[{"text":"i'm fine.","start":0,"end":1.03},{"text":"…","start":2.92,"end":3.11},{"text":"i said i'm fine, that's— four times, i","start":3.11,"end":6.63},{"text":"know.","start":6.63,"end":7.27},{"text":"i can count.","start":7.48,"end":9.15},{"text":"i'm not gripping the wheel.","start":10,"end":12.23},{"text":"i'm just…","start":12.4,"end":13.67},{"text":"holding it.","start":13.67,"end":15.27},{"text":"that's what wheels are for.","start":15.44,"end":18.31},{"text":"yeah, the engine's off.","start":18.67,"end":21.75},{"text":"i know it's off.","start":22.04,"end":23.67},{"text":"[slowly] i'm just sitting here.","start":24.32,"end":26.55},{"text":"…","start":27.79,"end":28.39},{"text":"what?","start":28.34,"end":29.35},{"text":"can't a guy sit in a car?","start":29.32,"end":31.11},{"text":"it was a good party.","start":32.19,"end":33.91},{"text":"it was fine.","start":34.16,"end":36.07},{"text":"everything's fine tonight, apparently.","start":36.04,"end":39.27},{"text":"very fine night.","start":39.38,"end":41.67},{"text":"hmmmmm.","start":42.77,"end":44.07},{"text":"…","start":45.13,"end":45.67},{"text":"sorry.","start":45.63,"end":46.63},{"text":"that came out— never mind.","start":46.63,"end":49.99},{"text":"no, i had fun.","start":50.54,"end":53.03},{"text":"i did.","start":53.33,"end":54.48},{"text":"i talked to…","start":54.92,"end":56.55},{"text":"people.","start":56.56,"end":58.07},{"text":"there were people.","start":58.14,"end":60.07},{"text":"i talked to some of them.","start":60.52,"end":62.39},{"text":"i don't know, an hour?","start":63.2,"end":65.59},{"text":"two?","start":65.75,"end":67.12},{"text":"i wasn't watching the clock.","start":67.56,"end":69.68},{"text":"i wasn't watching anything.","start":70.25,"end":72.32},{"text":"…","start":73.78,"end":74.48},{"text":"why are you looking at me like that.","start":74.48,"end":76.32},{"text":"i'm not avoiding your eyes, i'm looking at","start":77.05,"end":80.4},{"text":"the street.","start":80.4,"end":81.36},{"text":"there's a whole street out there.","start":81.36,"end":83.84},{"text":"very interesting street.","start":83.99,"end":86.56},{"text":"ahhhhh…","start":87.23,"end":89.28},{"text":"tired.","start":89.27,"end":90.84},{"text":"long night.","start":90.82,"end":92.23},{"text":"we should— you should probably head in,","start":92.48,"end":96.64},{"text":"right?","start":96.64,"end":97.28},{"text":"it's late.","start":97.34,"end":99.09},{"text":"…","start":99.86,"end":100.32},{"text":"okay.","start":100.28,"end":101.12},{"text":"you're not moving.","start":101.25,"end":103.88},{"text":"great.","start":103.85,"end":104.8},{"text":"we're doing this.","start":104.89,"end":106.4},{"text":"doing what?","start":106.71,"end":108.8},{"text":"nothing.","start":108.88,"end":110.96},{"text":"we're doing nothing, that's my whole","start":110.99,"end":113.44},{"text":"point, there's nothing to—","start":113.44,"end":115.76},{"text":"who?","start":116.08,"end":118.02},{"text":"…","start":118.75,"end":119.2},{"text":"him.","start":119.2,"end":119.92},{"text":"yeah.","start":120.07,"end":122.12},{"text":"no, i know who you mean.","start":122.19,"end":124.88},{"text":"i just—","start":125.42,"end":126.21},{"text":"he seemed…","start":126.75,"end":128.65},{"text":"nice.","start":128.66,"end":129.57},{"text":"nice…","start":129.77,"end":131.81},{"text":"guy.","start":131.8,"end":132.93},{"text":"who exists.","start":132.92,"end":134.29},{"text":"and tells stories.","start":134.6,"end":137.33},{"text":"very long stories with a lot of hand","start":137.46,"end":140.93},{"text":"gestures, apparently, but who's counting","start":140.93,"end":145.09},{"text":"the hand gestures.","start":145.09,"end":146.77},{"text":"not me.","start":146.92,"end":148.73},{"text":"that's not a tone.","start":149.3,"end":152.05},{"text":"this is my voice.","start":152.15,"end":154.69},{"text":"this is just how it sounds when i'm—","start":154.79,"end":158.29},{"text":"…","start":158.98,"end":159.49},{"text":"when i'm tired.","start":159.49,"end":160.45},{"text":"…","start":161.68,"end":162.29},{"text":"say it again?","start":162.29,"end":163.01},{"text":"no.","start":163.68,"end":164.93},{"text":"that's not—","start":164.95,"end":166.37},{"text":"i'm not jealous.","start":166.7,"end":168.69},{"text":"i just— …","start":168.74,"end":171.25},{"text":"come here.","start":171.25,"end":171.89},{"text":"…","start":172.88,"end":173.41},{"text":"please.","start":173.41,"end":174.29},{"text":"just—","start":174.38,"end":175.57},{"text":"ahhhhh.","start":176.64,"end":178.29},{"text":"okay.","start":178.25,"end":179.01},{"text":"[slowly] okay, hold on.","start":179.74,"end":182.37},{"text":"give me a second, because i'm about to say","start":182.44,"end":185.97},{"text":"something stupid and it needs to come out","start":185.97,"end":188.77},{"text":"in the right order.","start":188.77,"end":190.29},{"text":"…","start":191.4,"end":191.97},{"text":"i watched you laugh tonight.","start":191.97,"end":193.57},{"text":"at whatever he said.","start":193.74,"end":195.97},{"text":"the thing with the— i couldn't even hear","start":196.06,"end":199.89},{"text":"it from across the room, and you did that","start":199.89,"end":202.61},{"text":"laugh.","start":202.61,"end":203.49},{"text":"the real one.","start":203.54,"end":205.65},{"text":"the one where your whole head goes back","start":205.66,"end":208.21},{"text":"and you grab someone's arm because you","start":208.21,"end":210.21},{"text":"can't—","start":210.21,"end":210.69},{"text":"yeah.","start":210.95,"end":212.21},{"text":"that one.","start":212.23,"end":213.49},{"text":"and i stood there with my drink and i","start":214.42,"end":217.17},{"text":"thought…","start":217.17,"end":218.05},{"text":"…","start":219.28,"end":219.89},{"text":"i thought you looked happier over there","start":219.89,"end":221.81},{"text":"than you've looked with me lately.","start":221.81,"end":223.81},{"text":"that's it.","start":223.93,"end":225.57},{"text":"that's the whole ugly thing.","start":225.67,"end":228.93},{"text":"that's what's been sitting in my chest for","start":228.93,"end":230.99},{"text":"the last hour while i said \"fine\" like an","start":230.99,"end":234.75},{"text":"idiot.","start":234.75,"end":235.39},{"text":"no— don't.","start":236.68,"end":239.31},{"text":"don't do the face.","start":239.28,"end":240.99},{"text":"i'm not saying it to make you—","start":241.48,"end":244.51},{"text":"i know it's not fair.","start":245.56,"end":247.31},{"text":"i know.","start":247.48,"end":248.35},{"text":"he tells one funny story and i rewrite our","start":248.63,"end":252.03},{"text":"entire— that's insane, i know it's insane","start":251.98,"end":256.59},{"text":"while i'm doing it, that's the worst part.","start":256.59,"end":259.47},{"text":"there's a guy in my head going \"you sound","start":259.56,"end":263.39},{"text":"crazy\" and i'm going \"yes, thank you,","start":263.39,"end":268.59},{"text":"aware.\"","start":268.55,"end":269.47},{"text":"[chuckles] …","start":269.76,"end":272.11},{"text":"you know what i did in this car before you","start":272.11,"end":273.87},{"text":"got in?","start":273.87,"end":274.51},{"text":"i practiced.","start":274.96,"end":276.51},{"text":"casual.","start":276.6,"end":278.51},{"text":"i rehearsed sounding like a person who was","start":278.92,"end":281.79},{"text":"not bothered.","start":281.79,"end":282.99},{"text":"out loud.","start":283.12,"end":285.03},{"text":"to the steering wheel.","start":285.03,"end":286.75},{"text":"\"how was the party?\" — like that, all","start":287.12,"end":291.15},{"text":"breezy.","start":291.15,"end":292.11},{"text":"the wheel was very convinced.","start":292.26,"end":295.07},{"text":"you…","start":295.24,"end":297.15},{"text":"less so.","start":297.15,"end":297.95},{"text":"three seconds.","start":298.25,"end":300.59},{"text":"it took you three seconds.","start":300.81,"end":303.79},{"text":"…","start":305.02,"end":305.63},{"text":"yeah, you can laugh.","start":305.63,"end":307.95},{"text":"laugh at me, i deserve it, it's—","start":307.92,"end":311.47},{"text":"hmmmmm.","start":311.8,"end":313.23},{"text":"no, that laugh's okay.","start":313.59,"end":316.59},{"text":"that one i get to have.","start":316.71,"end":319.55},{"text":"…","start":320.6,"end":321.15},{"text":"hey.","start":321.15,"end":321.55},{"text":"hands off the wheel, see?","start":321.6,"end":324.11},{"text":"turning.","start":324.19,"end":325.95},{"text":"facing you.","start":326.02,"end":328.19},{"text":"full eye contact — this is very hard for","start":328.26,"end":332.83},{"text":"me right now, please note the effort.","start":332.83,"end":335.71},{"text":"[slowly] here's the thing i actually mean,","start":336.33,"end":339.36},{"text":"under all the stupid.","start":339.36,"end":340.88},{"text":"i don't think you're going anywhere.","start":342.05,"end":344.32},{"text":"it was never really about him.","start":344.71,"end":347.84},{"text":"it's that…","start":348.12,"end":350.6},{"text":"when you laughed like that, some small","start":350.62,"end":354.96},{"text":"pathetic part of me went, \"when's the last","start":354.96,"end":357.76},{"text":"time i made her do that?\" and i couldn't","start":357.76,"end":361.28},{"text":"remember.","start":361.28,"end":361.68},{"text":"and it scared me.","start":361.85,"end":364.16},{"text":"that's the truth.","start":364.29,"end":366.24},{"text":"scared me more than any guy at any party","start":366.71,"end":370.96},{"text":"ever could.","start":370.93,"end":373.28},{"text":"…","start":374.55,"end":374.76},{"text":"don't— hey, no, don't cry, that's not— oh","start":374.76,"end":380.8},{"text":"no.","start":380.79,"end":381.28},{"text":"come here.","start":381.45,"end":383.52},{"text":"come here.","start":383.73,"end":385.76},{"text":"[slowly] ahhhhh…","start":386.77,"end":388.16},{"text":"okay.","start":388.32,"end":390.92},{"text":"okay.","start":391.02,"end":392.24},{"text":"i've got you.","start":393.35,"end":395.52},{"text":"shhh.","start":395.67,"end":397.04},{"text":"i've got you.","start":397.29,"end":398.64},{"text":"…","start":400.11,"end":400.8},{"text":"last week?","start":400.8,"end":401.76},{"text":"really?","start":401.79,"end":403.6},{"text":"the thing with the— [chuckles] — the","start":403.61,"end":407.12},{"text":"grocery store thing?","start":407.12,"end":408.64},{"text":"that made the list?","start":408.69,"end":410.4},{"text":"that's…","start":411.13,"end":412.64},{"text":"good to know.","start":412.73,"end":414.64},{"text":"honestly, i thought my material was","start":414.64,"end":417.2},{"text":"slipping.","start":417.2,"end":417.84},{"text":"no, listen— hey.","start":418.47,"end":422.24},{"text":"look at me.","start":422.35,"end":424},{"text":"last thing, then i'll stop being heavy,","start":424.21,"end":428.24},{"text":"promise.","start":428.24,"end":429.04},{"text":"if i ever do that again — the fine, fine,","start":429.48,"end":434.32},{"text":"i'm fine routine — you're allowed to just…","start":434.32,"end":438.88},{"text":"poke me.","start":438.88,"end":439.76},{"text":"in the ribs.","start":439.83,"end":441.84},{"text":"hard.","start":441.84,"end":442.88},{"text":"because marinating in it for an hour was","start":442.88,"end":446.32},{"text":"so much worse than just saying \"i got","start":446.32,"end":450},{"text":"scared watching you laugh at another man's","start":450,"end":452.56},{"text":"joke.\" which, out loud, is somehow both","start":452.52,"end":459.28},{"text":"more embarrassing and…","start":459.28,"end":461.28},{"text":"lighter.","start":461.33,"end":463.96},{"text":"it's lighter now.","start":464.17,"end":466.08},{"text":"how is it lighter now?","start":466.29,"end":469.31},{"text":"…","start":470.16,"end":470.64},{"text":"because you didn't laugh at me.","start":470.64,"end":473.44},{"text":"yeah.","start":473.68,"end":476.08},{"text":"maybe that's it.","start":476.05,"end":477.52},{"text":"c'mere.","start":478.05,"end":479.2},{"text":"forehead.","start":479.36,"end":481.28},{"text":"just—","start":481.45,"end":482.88},{"text":"[slowly] …","start":483.51,"end":484.37},{"text":"there.","start":484.37,"end":484.56},{"text":"hmmmmm.","start":484.89,"end":487.04},{"text":"you smell like the party.","start":487.05,"end":489.04},{"text":"smoke and…","start":489.2,"end":491.36},{"text":"somebody's terrible cologne.","start":491.36,"end":494.32},{"text":"not yours.","start":494.41,"end":495.84},{"text":"please not yours.","start":495.88,"end":498.08},{"text":"[chuckles] okay, his.","start":498.33,"end":501.88},{"text":"noted.","start":501.92,"end":502.96},{"text":"filing that away in a healthy, non-jealous","start":503.37,"end":507.28},{"text":"manner.","start":507.28,"end":507.92},{"text":"…","start":509.39,"end":510.08},{"text":"i'm sorry about the silent car ride.","start":510.08,"end":512.56},{"text":"longest ten minutes of my life, for the","start":512.72,"end":516},{"text":"record.","start":516,"end":516.56},{"text":"every sentence i started began with \"so,","start":516.69,"end":522.12},{"text":"that guy,\" and i knew how that would","start":522.12,"end":525.52},{"text":"sound, so i said nothing, which sounded","start":525.47,"end":529.2},{"text":"worse.","start":529.2,"end":529.84},{"text":"genius move.","start":529.92,"end":532.67},{"text":"you're warm.","start":533.25,"end":534.56},{"text":"stay like this a second.","start":534.72,"end":538.08},{"text":"just…","start":538.11,"end":540.08},{"text":"one more second.","start":540.08,"end":541.2},{"text":"ahhhhh…","start":541.75,"end":543.52},{"text":"…","start":544.75,"end":545.36},{"text":"okay.","start":545.32,"end":546.08},{"text":"it's late.","start":546.2,"end":547.44},{"text":"you should go in.","start":547.53,"end":549.36},{"text":"but i'm walking you to the door.","start":549.53,"end":552.64},{"text":"slow.","start":552.86,"end":555.24},{"text":"embarrassingly slow.","start":555.28,"end":557.36},{"text":"old-man-with-a-newspaper slow.","start":557.59,"end":561.2},{"text":"because i did the math and the door is","start":561.2,"end":563.91},{"text":"only thirty feet away, and i'm not done","start":563.91,"end":567.75},{"text":"being next to you yet.","start":567.75,"end":569.35},{"text":"[chuckles] …","start":570.04,"end":572.55},{"text":"yeah.","start":572.55,"end":573.03},{"text":"that was smoother than anything i said all","start":573.09,"end":576.31},{"text":"night, wasn't it.","start":576.31,"end":577.51},{"text":"don't tell the steering wheel.","start":578.51,"end":580.55},{"text":"it thinks i'm cool.","start":580.67,"end":582.31},{"text":"come on.","start":582.72,"end":584.55},{"text":"slow.","start":584.66,"end":585.91},{"text":"i mean it.","start":586.04,"end":587.19}]